<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Igitz creature port (Pass 10).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Igitz` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: the donor's custom `Igitz` BodyDef is, like RSW_Anooba/RSW_Borcatu/
  RSW_Cannok/RSW_Clodhopper/RSW_Eopie/RSW_Gorg, entirely vanilla-part
  composition (2x Tail, Spine, Stomach, Heart, Lung x2, Kidney x2, Liver,
  Neck/Head/Skull/Brain/Eye x2/Ear x2/Nose/AnimalJaw, 4x Leg/Paw) — ported
  as RSW_Igitz with a defName rename only, no new body part needed
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml).

  `leatherDef` stays vanilla Core `Leather_Light` — no port needed (same as
  RSW_Dianoga/RSW_Gorg). `specificMeatDef` repoints to the already-ported
  RSW_Gorg_Meat (RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml, Pass 7/Pass 9 — the donor's
  own `Gorg_Meat` this species' meat points at too). Its 2 eggs are newly
  ported (RSW_EggIgitzFertilized/UnFertilized, texPath
  swresource/EggAmphispawn, newly extracted this pass).

  This species also carries a `modExtensions` block gated
  `MayRequire="pathfinding.framework"` (amphibious movement) — kept
  verbatim, unchanged text, same donor-authored gate.

  No `canCrossBreedWith` in the donor.

  Art: extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the live Steam
  workshop bundle (workshop folder 3497316713) — 11 PNGs (base + Dessicated
  + Swimming, juvenile Igitz_j variants with Dessicated), all confirmed
  non-zero and PIL-openable. One casing fix: the bundle's own internal name
  for the juvenile south-facing frame is lowercase (`igitz_j_south`) unlike
  every sibling frame — renamed to `Igitz_j_south.png` to match the def's
  own texPath casing (the same case-sensitivity trap `validate_patch.py`
  has caught before, e.g. FrilledGorg's Pass 8). Art sits at
  Textures/swanimals/Igitz/.

  🔴 **Real donor-bundle asset gap found and worked around**: the donor's
  own PawnKindDef references `swanimals/Igitz/Igitz_j_Swimming` for the
  juvenile life stage's swimming graphic, but NO such texture exists
  anywhere in the AssetBundle — confirmed via extract_bundle.py's list mode
  (11 total Igitz matches, none named `Igitz_j_Swimming*`). `validate_patch.py`
  (live-dump mode) caught this as a real error (pink placeholder). This is a donor
  bug, not an extraction miss — the donor mod itself would render this the
  same way today. Worked around by repointing the juvenile
  `swimmingGraphicData` to the already-extracted adult `Igitz_Swimming`
  texPath instead (same pattern every other life stage here already uses —
  sharing one texPath across stages at different `drawSize`), rather than
  leaving the juvenile stage broken or omitting `swimmingGraphicData`
  entirely.

  No `*ArtOverride` mod exists for this species (checked the full ~26-mod
  override-folder listing, not a remembered short list).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: `AridShrubland` only (0.7,
  status `keep`) — the donor's own `wildBiomes` lists TropicalSwamp/
  TemperateForest/TropicalRainforest/TemperateSwamp/ColdBog at nonzero
  weight (kept verbatim below, unmodified, per every prior pass's
  convention), but `cast_assignment.csv`'s own ground truth has exactly one
  live row for this species. Repointed from the bare "Igitz" entry in
  cast_assignment.csv / both BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml copies.
-->
<Defs>
<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Igitz</defName>
    <label>igitz</label>
    <description>Igitz were a species of small amphibians hailing from the planet Naboo. Those blue-skinned, omnivorous critters dwelled in the planet's many dense swamps. Because of the environment in which they had evolved, the igitz were well-adapted to both land and water: while their front paws were clawed for treading on land, their hindquarters were finned, allowing it speed when in water. The igitz were a popular pet in most Gungan civilizations and this lead to the species becoming present on other worlds.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>4.0</MoveSpeed>
      <MarketValue>150</MarketValue>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-8</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <FilthRate>2</FilthRate>
      <Wildness>0.30</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>left paw</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Scratch</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>3.0</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>FrontLeftPaw</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>right paw</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Scratch</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>3.0</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>FrontRightPaw</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>fish teeth</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>4.8</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Teeth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <chanceFactor>0.7</chanceFactor>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>head</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>6</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>HeadAttackTool</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>true</ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>
        <chanceFactor>0.2</chanceFactor>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <modExtensions>
      <li MayRequire="pathfinding.framework" Class="PathfindingFramework.MovementExtension">
        <movementDef>PF_Movement_Amphibious</movementDef>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_EggLayer">
        <eggUnfertilizedDef>RSW_EggIgitzUnFertilized</eggUnfertilizedDef>
        <eggFertilizedDef>RSW_EggIgitzFertilized</eggFertilizedDef>
        <eggFertilizationCountMax>1</eggFertilizationCountMax>
        <eggLayIntervalDays>5</eggLayIntervalDays>
        <eggCountRange>2~4</eggCountRange>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <race>
      <body>RSW_Igitz</body>
      <predator>true</predator>
      <baseBodySize>0.32</baseBodySize>
      <baseHungerRate>0.10</baseHungerRate>
      <baseHealthScale>0.4</baseHealthScale>
      <foodType>OmnivoreAnimal, OvivoreAnimal, AnimalProduct</foodType>
      <leatherDef>Leather_Light</leatherDef>
      <specificMeatDef>RSW_Gorg_Meat</specificMeatDef>
      <trainability>Intermediate</trainability>
      <petness>0.5</petness>
      <nameGenerator>SWAnimalNamerMale</nameGenerator>
      <nameGeneratorFemale>SWAnimalNamerFemale</nameGeneratorFemale>
      <nameOnTameChance>1</nameOnTameChance>
      <lifeExpectancy>16</lifeExpectancy>
